    <item>
      <title>Cuba: Independent experts condemn new US sanctions as humanitarian crisis deepens</title>
      <link>https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/08/1168094</link>
      <description>Independent UN human rights experts on Thursday condemned a fresh round of US sanctions against Cuba, calling them an attempt to force change on “a sovereign State through threats and coercion.”</description>
